WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:58.310
<b>Monsters of the Grand Line</b>

38
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:17.830
<b>Front Entrance
Arlong Park</b>

39
00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.830
That looks like it's ready.

40
00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:27.340
[trumpet noises]

41
00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:31.130
[HATCHAN] Momooo! Lunchtime! Momoo!

42
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.090
Where is he? Kinda weird.

43
00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:37.570
I've never seen Momoo
show up late to a meal.

44
00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:39.060
I wonder what happened?

45
00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:48.650
Genzo!

46
00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:49.820
[gasps]

47
00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:53.240
[ARLONG] The possession of weapons
is a clear affront to my authority.

48
00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.450
As an example to any other
would-be rebels in this town,

49
00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:58.780
I'm going to kill you right now.

50
00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.160
So they can see the fate
that awaits them!

51
00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:04.750
[gasps] No way! That guy is insane!

52
00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.920
He'd kill someone for
just having a weapon!

53
00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:08.170
I won't let him!

54
00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:11.170
[USOPP gasps] Hey, wait!
Don't go out there!

55
00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:13.840
[NOJIKO] You have absolutely
no right to do this, Arlong!

56
00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.380
[ARLONG] Heh?

57
00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.180
We've paid your tribute without
fail for over eight years.

58
00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:21.430
Why would we rebel against it now?

59
00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:26.020
Just think about it. It makes no sense!

60
00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.150
Now take your hands off Genzo!

61
00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.060
[VILLAGER A] Yeah!

62
00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.020
[VILLAGER F] It's not like
he used the weapons!

63
00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:33.820
[VILLAGER C] That's right! Let him go!

64
00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.650
[VILLAGER D] Yeah, let Genzo go!

65
00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:40.580
[ARLONG] Hoarding weapons shows
he was planning a rebellion against me.

66
00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.580
But on the other hand...
I could destroy you all.

67
00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.830
Please, try to protect your
friend so you won't give me

68
00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:53.590
an excuse to do that. Either way is fine,
but rebellions will not be tolerated.

69
00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.220
[GENZO grunts]
Everybody just go home.

70
00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:59.870
Do you want to waste all of our
work over the past eight years?

71
00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:02.680
For what? The time for
you to give your lives

72
00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.600
for this village was back
when they first came.

73
00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.810
Now we must continue to be patient.

74
00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:11.060
The most important thing is
that we continue to live!

75
00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:14.230
We swore we would not let them
defeat us as long as we're alive...

76
00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.110
Genzo!

77
00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.570
No...

78
00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:20.570
Well said! I agree with you...

79
00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:26.580
Heh... it's good to know that even disgusting
insects like you enjoy being alive!

80
00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:28.080
[groans]

81
00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.330
Oh, no!

82
00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:34.500
There is no way any of you will ever come
close to the perfection of the fishman.

83
00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.420
[laughs]

84
00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:37.170
Damn you!

85
00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:37.880
Don't move!

86
00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:40.340
He wants you to attack.

87
00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.760
[GENZO grunts]

88
00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.550
We can't just stand here!

89
00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:45.220
[gasps]

90
00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.510
[GENZO] Your deaths will mean nothing!

91
00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.650
You must continue to be patient...

92
00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.810
[GENZO grunts]
... even if I die.

93
00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.940
[ARLONG] That's a good ending for you.

94
00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:57.320
Pay close attention, humans!

95
00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.460
This is what happens
to those who defy me,

96
00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.630
even if it is just
inside their tiny heads!

97
00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.620
[USOPP] Exploding Star!

98
00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:07.620
[GENZO groans]

99
00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.410
Huh? What was that?

100
00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.210
Huh? Up there! Look!

101
00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.590
There's someone on the roof!

102
00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.880
[FISHMAN C] Who the hell is that guy?!

103
00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:24.720
I am... the great warrior
of the sea, Captain Usopp!

104
00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:27.430
Usopp...

105
00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:32.580
Also known as the Demon King Usopp,
feared and hated by almost half the world!

106
00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:36.400
I command thousands of men!
Loyal and vicious men!

107
00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.230
That's the guy I told you about!

108
00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.320
The one with the long
nose that got away!

109
00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:41.070
[USOPP yelps]

110
00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:44.370
[ARLONG] Bring on your thousands of men!

111
00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:47.870
I'll crush them one by one.

112
00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.870
[gasps]

113
00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:52.250
[USOPP] The Exploding Star did
nothing and now he's pissed!

114
00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.750
[ARLONG] Repulsive human.

115
00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.250
What can a creature like you do to me!

116
00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.920
– [USOPP gasps, shouts]
– [ARLONG grunts]

117
00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.430
[VILLAGERS gasp]

118
00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:04.720
[yelps]

119
00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.850
Arlong, hold on just a second!

120
00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:10.990
After losing Gosa, we can't afford
to kill off any more tribute money!

121
00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:16.680
[FISHMAN H] Villages are fun to destroy,
but ruling over them makes us more money!

122
00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:20.360
[ARLONG] If we lose some,
we can always get more.

123
00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:23.150
Fishmen must reign supreme!

124
00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:24.990
[ALL gasp]

125
00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.780
He's destroying it all!

126
00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.290
Usopp!

127
00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:33.320
[USOPP gasps]
Am I... dead... yet?!

128
00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.460
He's not dead yet!

129
00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:35.250
[USOPP] Aw, crap!

130
00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:36.460
[FISHMAN F] Get him!

131
00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:40.380
Catch him and tear him apart!

132
00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:44.880
[FISHMAN K] Let's go back to Arlong Park
before he destroys everything!

133
00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.270
[FISHMAN J] Yeah, I'm with you!

134
00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:49.350
[ARLONG growls]
Don't let him get away!

135
00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.350
Who does that chumsucker think he is?

136
00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:55.310
We'll be back.
You can all live for now.

137
00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.610
[GENZO grunts]

138
00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:05.070
[GENZO] I'm so sorry, everybody.
This has all been my fault.

139
00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.410
What are you talking about?
You're not a fishman, are you?

140
00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:09.240
[VILLAGER F] Yeah!

141
00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.870
But who was that guy who attacked?

142
00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.200
[panting]

143
00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.460
[NAMI] Hello, everyone!

144
00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.000
It's good to be back home.

145
00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:17.460
[NOJIKO] Nami?!

146
00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:18.210
[VILLAGER B] It's Nami!

147
00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:19.420
[VILLAGER C] You!

148
00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.130
What's wrong?

149
00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:31.230
You never just come walking
through Cocoyashi anymore.

150
00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:34.890
I heard quite a commotion. Arlong, huh?

151
00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.320
[NAMI] I only have to get
seven million more berries.

152
00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:52.830
Your already bad reputation
just keeps getting worse.

153
00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.500
That's fine. I am a pirate.

154
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.080
Arlong can be a very reasonable
guy when he wants to.

155
00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:01.210
I just need a little more money
to finish our agreement.

156
00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:05.170
Just seven million berries
shy of the 100 million goal.

157
00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:09.340
You know, it's really not that
high a price considering...

158
00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:11.430
... that it's gonna buy
back our village! Heh!

159
00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:20.020
[ZORO] She tells me to run, but I got
nowhere else to go but here.

160
00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:23.860
Besides, I promised Luffy
I'd bring her back with me.

161
00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:26.570
Man... what's he up to?

162
00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:29.030
'Cause things are getting
messy around here.

163
00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.450
[YOSAKU] I did. I put it
on my plate. It's mine.

164
00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.910
That's how it works.

165
00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.960
[LUFFY] Okay, sorry. How 'bout
you eat this thing instead?

166
00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.760
[YOSAKU] I wouldn't feed that
rotten slop to my dog!

167
00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.050
[growling]

168
00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:48.630
[SANJI] Shh. Quiet.

169
00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.390
[growling continues]

170
00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.470
There's something down there.

171
00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:58.890
It's big.

172
00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.140
[YOSAKU gasps]

173
00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.940
[growling]

174
00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:05.400
[screams]

175
00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.820
[LUFFY] What the hell is that?

176
00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:09.530
[growling]

177
00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:13.620
[YOSAKU] Sea monster!

178
00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:14.370
<b>Momoo the Sea Cow
Heavy Combat Beast
Arlong Pirates</b>

179
00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:17.330
It's a cow!

180
00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:21.300
Not cow... They don't swim. A hippo?

181
00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:24.170
Whatever it is, you can tell
it's from the Grand Line!

182
00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:27.740
What is it doing all the way
out here in the East Blue?

183
00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.670
[LUFFY] Hmm...

184
00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.550
[LUFFY] Why is he staring at us?

185
00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:36.970
[YOSAKU grunts]

186
00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:37.920
[YOSAKU] He wants the food!

187
00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:38.470
[LUFFY] What?

188
00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:41.140
[YOSAKU] Quick, give it to
him before he sinks the ship!

189
00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:43.940
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum Pistol!

190
00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.380
Bad sea cow! Stay away from our food!

191
00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:53.030
Ha! Yes! You knocked it out!

192
00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.370
[growling]

193
00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.870
[YOSAKU yelps]
Oh, crap! You made it mad!

194
00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.250
You back for more?

195
00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.410
[SANJI] Dumbass.

196
00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:03.290
There's no reason to punch
this poor hungry hippo.

197
00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.830
She's probably just a baby and
can't catch food for herself yet.

198
00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.630
Huh? That right?

199
00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.700
You're insane...

200
00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.260
[SANJI] Here you go. Eat up.

201
00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:15.510
Don't be scared. I won't hit you.

202
00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.270
[growls]

203
00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.390
[SANJI shouts]

204
00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.230
[YOSAKU gasps]

205
00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:30.350
What the hell are you doing?! Damn jerk!

206
00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:33.360
[SANJI] It was gonna eat me
with the plate. What could I do?

207
00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.240
[growls]

208
00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.410
[YOSAKU screams]

209
00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.300
[YOSAKU] Here it comes!

210
00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.130
Right.

211
00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.000
[SANJI] Stand back. This is my show.

212
00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:47.880
[SANJI] Collier Coup!

213
00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.510
[BOTH gasp]

214
00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.720
That's that.

215
00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:58.140
[momoo groans]

216
00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:00.170
Yes! And back to the food!

217
00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:01.670
That was refreshing.

218
00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:04.850
[YOSAKU] You guys are insane. Seriously.

219
00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:10.020
[ZORO grunts]
What's taking so long?

220
00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:15.780
[ZORO] Luffy... Where are you?

221
00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:18.950
Five more minutes of this and
I'll keel over from boredom.

222
00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.910
[HATCHAN grunts]

223
00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:23.420
[HATCHAN] Incredible! What are you?!

224
00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:27.080
Some kind of super-fish?!
Not even the mighty Hatchan,

225
00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:30.690
octopus leader of the Arlong
Pirates can pull you from the ocean!

226
00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:33.380
What an epic battle!
I don't know who you are,

227
00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:36.090
but you're the gutsiest
fish in the East Blue!

228
00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:41.060
Hey! What the...?! It was me all along?!

229
00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.770
[HATCHAN yelps]

230
00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:46.020
[HATCHAN grunts]
You are indeed the gutsiest fish

231
00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:47.900
in the East Blue... Me.

232
00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.650
Hold on. That's weird.

233
00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:51.320
It sure is.

234
00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:54.900
[HATCHAN] Huh? Hey!
Who're you?! Speak up, now!

235
00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.490
Who? Me? Well...

236
00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:01.410
I'm Hatchan! But all my
friends call me Hatchi!

237
00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.290
[ZORO] You a fishman too?

238
00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:07.160
Of course! Of course!
I'm an amazing octopus fishman!

239
00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.330
It looks to me like
you're just a human.

240
00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:10.500
[ZORO] Uh... Yeah.

241
00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.670
A Marine... Or possibly a guest.

242
00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:14.880
A guest?

243
00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:18.010
Uh... you could say that.

244
00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.220
[HATCHAN] Arlong isn't here, is he?

245
00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:23.170
[ZORO] No. I thought you
might know where he is.

246
00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:27.100
[HATCHAN] Apparently there's some long-nosed
guy running around causing trouble.

247
00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.980
So Arlong locked up the
long nose's friend here,

248
00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:33.450
then went to Cocoyashi Village
to hunt down that pesky troublemaker.

249
00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.190
Oh man... Usopp.

250
00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.990
[ZORO] Well, I guess I'd better save him.

251
00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:42.990
[ZORO] This Cocoyashi Village.
How do I get there?

252
00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.120
Get in.

253
00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:45.740
[ZORO] Hm?

254
00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:51.830
You're a guest. Hop in.
I'll take you, swordsman.

255
00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:06.720
Aw man, I can't shake these guys!

256
00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:10.230
[USOPP grunts]

257
00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.520
[FISHMAN E] Hey, where'd he go?

258
00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:17.490
[USOPP] All those in favor of
leaving Usopp alone say "aye."

259
00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:21.060
[USOPP] Aye! Aye! Aye! Aye! Aye!

260
00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:23.870
You fool. You're dumber than I thought!

261
00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:25.950
[USOPP] Ah, you agree
with me too? That's great!

262
00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.120
[FISHMEN grunt]

263
00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.000
[USOPP] He, he.

264
00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:34.040
[FISHMEN] Huh?

265
00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:38.710
Egg Star... Special Attack!

266
00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:41.800
[FISHMAN E groans]
Rotten eggs!

267
00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.760
[FISHMAN K groans]
I think I'm gonna ralph!

268
00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:48.470
[USOPP giggles]
I guess fishmen

269
00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.520
aren't all they're cracked up to be!

270
00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:53.900
Not one of those scaly morons
can catch Captain Usopp!

271
00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:55.690
[giggling continues]

272
00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:10.660
[USOPP] Huh? Hey... Huh?

273
00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:11.410
What?

274
00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:16.630
[USOPP gasps] Yeah, I'm fine!
Thanks for asking!

275
00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:19.630
I made it down safe and
sound as you can see.

276
00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.800
[USOPP gasps]

277
00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.350
[HATCHAN] Cocoyashi Village.

278
00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:28.950
Arlong should be around here somewhere.

279
00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:30.520
[ZORO] Oh great, thanks.

280
00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.100
[HATCHAN] No problem. Bye now!

281
00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:36.810
Oh, one more thing...

282
00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:39.270
I completely forgot to
ask you your name.

283
00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:41.100
What do you mean? We've been over this.

284
00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:46.160
I told you my name.
Hatchan, nice to meet ya!

285
00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:48.780
That was strange.

286
00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.920
[ARLONG] What the hell happened here?!

287
00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.510
Who did this to you?

288
00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.260
[ARLONG growls]

289
00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.720
Tell me! Who did this, brothers?

290
00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.730
[FISHMAN L] Roronoa...

291
00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:17.940
[FISHMAN L groans]

292
00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:20.360
What...? What are you saying?

293
00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.320
Roronoa... Zoro.

294
00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.570
[ARLONG] Huh? What?

295
00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.970
[ARLONG] The pirate hunter...?
Has he come to collect my head?

296
00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:34.080
[FISHMAN L groans]
We had him. That man we caught.

297
00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:36.920
That was him. He was Zoro.

298
00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.100
That's him?!

299
00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.710
[FISHMAN L] Yes,
the swordsman was Roronoa...

300
00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.050
[USOPP groans]

301
00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:50.100
[CHOO] Choo. Arlong... Found him, he...

302
00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.180
[gasps]
What is this?!

303
00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:55.100
[USOPP gasps] Don't tell me that Zoro's...

304
00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:03.650
[ARLONG] Catching this scum isn't
enough to satisfy my hunger!

305
00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:08.320
[gasps] Oh yeah? Well, then let me go!

306
00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.370
Oh, and I'm sorry about earlier,
I was just saying hello!

307
00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.080
That's how we do it in my village!

308
00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.540
[chuckles nervously]

309
00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.870
Long nose, you are one of Zoro's men.

310
00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:24.590
It's only natural for well-known
bounty hunters to come after me.

311
00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:26.920
[USOPP gasps, giggles nervously]

312
00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.510
[USOPP] Please don't kill me!

313
00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:31.390
I don't have anything to
do with Zoro. I promise!

314
00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:33.930
Please don't kill me!

315
00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.560
[CHOO] Choo. Enough of your cowardly lies!

316
00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:40.270
Even if you don't know Zoro,
you still stood against Arlong.

317
00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.560
You die either way.

318
00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:45.320
[USOPP] Okay! No more lies!
Zoro and I are like brothers!

319
00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.110
Partners for life! If you
so much as lay one of your

320
00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:51.370
creepy webbed fingers on me,
he'll show up and kill you all!

321
00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:56.200
[ARLONG] Is that right? So, if I
kill you, Zoro will show up?

322
00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.160
[USOPP whines]

323
00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.280
[USOPP] No, no! That's not
what I was trying to say!

324
00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.130
I was trying to say the exact opposite.

325
00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:06.000
Killing me is bad! If you keep
me alive, Zoro will show up!

326
00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:07.380
See?!

327
00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.550
[KUROOBI] What I want to know is how...

328
00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:11.220
[ARLONG] Hm?

329
00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.760
[KUROOBI] How did he escape?

330
00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.260
[ARLONG] What do you mean?

331
00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:17.270
[KUROOBI] What I mean is,
someone let him escape.

332
00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.520
[ARLONG growls]

333
00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:22.060
I think that somebody has betrayed us.

334
00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.570
Perhaps it was Nami who let him in.

335
00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:27.070
So that bastard could take your head.

336
00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:28.280
[ARLONG grunts]

337
00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:31.200
[FISHMAN E] Now that you mention it,
she has been acting strange lately.

338
00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:31.950
[FISHMAN F] Yeah.

339
00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:34.320
She even helped Zoro when
he jumped into the water.

340
00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.990
[FISHMAN K] Don't tell me she
was working with Zoro from the start!

341
00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.910
[FISHMAN O] And tricked us all!

342
00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.170
[KUROOBI] Don't forget.
Her chief skill is deception.

343
00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.340
[NAMI] Enough of this!

344
00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.920
You should be ashamed.
This is pure conjecture!

345
00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:55.600
Nami...?

346
00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:59.350
[NAMI] I swore I was a member
of this group eight years ago.

347
00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:02.940
My loyalty... is shown
with this tattoo.

348
00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:08.940
I'm sorry, Nami. It's natural
for you to be upset.

349
00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:12.860
But you should know, I don't suspect
you of anything treacherous, Nami.

350
00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:15.870
I trust you.

351
00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:19.410
[ARLONG] After all, we've known
each other for eight years.

352
00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.980
We're just... a little
on edge right now.

353
00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:24.830
That's all. Surely you
can understand that.

354
00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:27.880
We need to focus on Zoro and
his gang of bounty hunters.

355
00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.210
[gasps]

356
00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.760
Hey! Nami! Say something!

357
00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:34.840
Please! Nami!

358
00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.970
[NAMI grunts] He just had
to go and do that...

359
00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:42.560
[ARLONG chuckles]

360
00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:44.270
[KUROOBI] What's wrong, Nami?

361
00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:49.440
You're pale... You feelin' okay?

362
00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:53.110
As for long-nose here...

363
00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.030
[USOPP gasps]

364
00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:56.950
[KUROOBI] Not even you can save him now.

365
00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:58.200
[USOPP whimpers]

366
00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:01.040
No... Not when he defied Arlong.

367
00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:04.500
How long?! How long will
I be suspected of betrayal?!

368
00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:07.980
[KUROOBI] You're too
clever for your own good.

369
00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:10.840
[NAMI] I'll have the amount
Arlong and I agreed to soon.

370
00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:13.470
It doesn't make any sense
for me to betray you now!

371
00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:14.300
[KUROOBI] I know.

372
00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:15.220
[USOPP gasps]

373
00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:18.300
[KUROOBI] Eight years ago
you agreed to purchase

374
00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:21.390
Cocoyashi Village for
100 million berries. Heh.

375
00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:25.530
But I just can't figure it out.

376
00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:28.060
You love nothing. Except money.

377
00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.750
You betrayed your family
and your village for it.

378
00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.530
So... Why do you care
for this village now?

379
00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:36.860
This puny little heap of houses.

380
00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:38.990
I thought long and hard about it.

381
00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.620
Then I found this... in your room.

382
00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:45.840
[ARLONG] Huh?

383
00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:49.250
It can't be... That's my...!

384
00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.420
[gasps]

385
00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:53.840
What?! What do you mean?
You're saying he was captured?

386
00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.080
Yeah!

387
00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:57.380
They took him back to Arlong
Park just a little while ago!

388
00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:00.830
That courageous young man stood
up to Arlong and those fishmen.

389
00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.600
He's probably dead by now!

390
00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.100
[VILLAGER A gasps]

391
00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.980
This is bad. They won't be forgiving.

392
00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.940
He got caught right
after my little visit.

393
00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:12.690
[ZORO grunts]

394
00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.940
[ZORO] Usopp! Hold on!

395
00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:36.420
[LUFFY] Yeah! Ha-ha!
Faster to Arlong Park!

396
00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:49.270
N... Nami! Hang on!

